00:19:19.781 --> 00:19:22.124
&gt;&gt; I'd first like to recognize some

00:19:22.124 --> 00:19:24.472
of the people who are here today.

00:19:24.472 --> 00:19:25.772
The GSB faculty and

00:19:25.772 --> 00:19:28.129
staff have played a pivotal role in

