a moment of thanks.

00:19:34.857 --> 00:19:44.857
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

00:19:50.674 --> 00:19:52.029
&gt;&gt; We also are joined by

00:19:52.029 --> 00:19:52.907
families and

00:19:52.907 --> 00:19:55.382
friends who have provided support,

00:19:55.382 --> 00:19:57.954
