01:12:32.086 --> 01:12:36.684
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH] &gt;&gt; Graduates names will

01:12:36.684 --> 01:12:38.667
now be ready by Jamie Shine,

01:12:38.667 --> 01:12:40.980
