02:04:22.572 --> 02:04:25.223
&gt;&gt; Nominated and chosen by their

02:04:25.223 --> 02:04:28.404
peers, the recipient of the Ernest

02:04:28.404 --> 02:04:31.479
C Arbuckle Award is the second year

02:04:31.479 --> 02:04:34.236
MBA student who by their active

02:04:34.236 --> 02:04:37.100
participation, initiative,

02:04:37.100 --> 02:04:40.724
leadership, and personal integrity.

02:04:40.724 --> 02:04:42.929
Is judged as having contributed

02:04:42.929 --> 02:04:44.726
most to the fulfillment of

02:04:44.726 --> 02:04:47.094
the goals of the Graduate School of

02:04:47.094 --> 02:04:49.218
Business in their actions both

02:04:49.218 --> 02:04:51.189
within school and society.

02:04:51.189 --> 02:04:52.336
We are delighted to

02:04:52.336 --> 02:04:54.488
have Susan Arbuckle, the daughter

02:04:54.488 --> 02:04:56.651
of Ernie Arbuckle, with us today.

02:04:56.651 --> 02:05:02.802
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE] &gt;&gt; The recipient

02:05:02.802 --> 02:05:04.398
receives a cash prize and

02:05:04.398 --> 02:05:06.450
also has their name on a plaque on

02:05:06.450 --> 02:05:08.740
display at the GSB.

02:05:08.740 --> 02:05:11.686
This year's recipient of the award

02:05:11.686 --> 02:05:12.968
is Keya Patel.

02:05:12.968 --> 02:05:22.968
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

02:06:23.705 --> 02:06:29.137
[APPLAUSE] &gt;&gt; The Alexander

02:06:29.137 --> 02:06:31.528
Robichek Student Achievement Award

02:06:31.528 --> 02:06:33.841
in Finance was established to honor

02:06:33.841 --> 02:06:36.233
Professor Robichek's outstanding

02:06:36.233 --> 02:06:38.161
contribution to the teaching

02:06:38.161 --> 02:06:39.471
of finance at the GSB

02:06:39.471 --> 02:06:42.338
from 1960 until his death in 1978.

02:06:42.338 --> 02:06:43.849
The award is given to an MBA

02:06:43.849 --> 02:06:45.706
student selected by the finance

02:06:45.706 --> 02:06:47.908
faculty for outstanding achievement

02:06:47.908 --> 02:06:50.210
in their finance courses.

02:06:50.210 --> 02:06:52.333
The recipient receives the award

02:06:52.333 --> 02:06:54.302
and has their name on display at

02:06:54.302 --> 02:06:54.920
the GSB.

02:06:56.900 --> 02:06:59.043
This year's recipient of the

02:06:59.043 --> 02:07:01.534
Robichek Award is Joshua Rowley.

02:07:01.534 --> 02:07:11.534
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

